  ('yugioh', '80181649', '"A Case for K9"', 'Spell Card', 'Starlight Rare', 'When this card is activated: You can add 1 "K9" monster from your Deck to your hand. "K9" monsters you control gain 900 ATK during any turn in which your opponent has activated a monster effect in the hand or GY. If this card in the Spell & Trap Zone is destroyed by card effect: You can Set 1 "K9" Quick-Play Spell from your Deck or GY. You can only use this effect of ""A Case for K9"" once per turn. You can only activate 1 ""A Case for K9"" per turn.', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/80181649.jpg', 'Justice Hunters', 'JUSH-EN040', 'https://ygoprodeck.com/card/a-case-for-k9-14990'),
  ('yugioh', '34541863', '"A" Cell Breeding Device', 'Spell Card', 'Common', 'During each of your Standby Phases, put 1 A-Counter on 1 face-up monster your opponent controls.', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/34541863.jpg', 'Force of the Breaker', 'FOTB-EN043', 'https://ygoprodeck.com/card/a-cell-breeding-device-9766'),
