  ('yugioh', '91231901', '"A" Cell Recombination Device', 'Spell Card', 'Common', 'Target 1 face-up monster on the field; send 1 "Alien" monster from your Deck to the Graveyard, and if you do, place A-Counters on that monster equal to the Level of the sent monster. During your Main Phase, except the turn this card was sent to the Graveyard: You can banish this card from your Graveyard; add 1 "Alien" monster from your Deck to your hand.', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/91231901.jpg', 'Invasion: Vengeance', 'INOV-EN063', 'https://ygoprodeck.com/card/a-cell-recombination-device-7614'),
