  ('yugioh', '90861137', '"Infernoble Arms - Joyeuse"', 'Spell Card', 'Super Rare', 'While this card is equipped to a monster: You can target 1 FIRE Warrior monster in your GY; add it to your hand, then destroy this card. If this card is sent to the GY because the equipped monster is sent to the GY: You can Special Summon 1 FIRE Warrior monster from your hand. You can only use 1 ""Infernoble Arms - Joyeuse"" effect per turn, and only once that turn.', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/90861137.jpg', '2021 Tin of Ancient Battles', 'MP21-EN138', 'https://ygoprodeck.com/card/infernoble-arms-joyeuse-10989'),
