  ('yugioh', '30012506', 'A-Assault Core', 'Union Effect Monster', 'Secret Rare', 'Once per turn, you can either: Target 1 LIGHT Machine monster you control; equip this card to that target, OR: Unequip this card and Special Summon it. A monster equipped with this card is unaffected by your opponent''s monster effects (except its own), also if the equipped monster would be destroyed by battle or card effect, destroy this card instead. If this card is sent from the field to the GY: You can add 1 other Union monster from your GY to your hand.', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/30012506.jpg', 'Legendary Collection Kaiba Mega Pack', 'LCKC-EN019', 'https://ygoprodeck.com/card/a-assault-core-2542'),
  ('yugioh', '13026402', 'A-Team: Trap Disposal Unit', 'Effect Monster', 'Rare', 'This effect can be used during either player''s turn. When your opponent activates a Trap Card, Tribute this face-up card to negate the activation of the Trap Card and destroy it.', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/13026402.jpg', 'Dark Revelation Volume 3', 'DR3-EN093', 'https://ygoprodeck.com/card/a-team-trap-disposal-unit-1122'),
  ('yugioh', '75926389', 'A-to-Z Energy Load', 'Trap Card', 'Collector''s Rare', 'When your opponent activates a card or effect: Draw cards equal to the number of Level 8 or higher LIGHT Machine Fusion Monsters you control. During your Standby Phase: You can banish this card from your GY; shuffle up to 6 of your banished LIGHT Machine monsters into the Deck, including a Union monster. You can only use each effect of "A-to-Z Energy Load" once per turn.', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/75926389.jpg', 'Maze of the Master', 'MZTM-EN024', 'https://ygoprodeck.com/card/a-to-z-energy-load-14494'),
