  ('yugioh', '59332125', 'A.I. Love Fusion', 'Spell Card', 'Common', 'Fusion Summon 1 Cyberse Fusion Monster from your Extra Deck, using monsters from your hand or field as Fusion Material. If you use your "@Ignister" monster as Fusion Material, you can also use 1 Link Monster your opponent controls as material. You can only activate 1 "A.I. Love Fusion" per turn.', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/59332125.jpg', '2021 Tin of Ancient Battles', 'MP21-EN024', 'https://ygoprodeck.com/card/a-i-love-fusion-10591'),
  ('yugioh', '6552971', 'A.I. Meet You', 'Spell Card', 'Ultra Rare', 'Reveal 1 Cyberse monster with 2300 ATK in your hand or Extra Deck, and add 1 "@Ignister" monster with the same Attribute from your Deck to your hand. During the End Phase of this turn, take 2300 damage if you did not Special Summon the revealed monster, or a monster with the same name, after you resolved this effect. You cannot activate monster effects for the rest of this turn after this card resolves, except Cyberse monsters. You can only activate 1 "A.I. Meet You" per turn.', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/6552971.jpg', '2022 Tin of the Pharaoh''s Gods', 'MP22-EN095', 'https://ygoprodeck.com/card/a-i-meet-you-11912'),
  ('yugioh', '77421977', 'A.I. Shadow', 'Trap Card', 'Common', 'Activate this card by targeting 1 "@Ignister" monster you control. That monster gains 800 ATK, also all monsters your opponent controls must attack that monster you control, if able. If this face-up card in its owner''s Spell & Trap Zone has left the field because of an opponent''s effect, and is now in the GY or banished: Draw 1 card. You can only use this effect of "A.I. Shadow" once per turn.', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/77421977.jpg', '2021 Tin of Ancient Battles', 'MP21-EN029', 'https://ygoprodeck.com/card/a-i-shadow-10605'),
  ('yugioh', '85327820', 'A.I.''s Ritual', 'Spell Card', 'Common', 'This card can be used to Ritual Summon any Cyberse Ritual Monster. You must also Tribute "@Ignister" monsters from your hand or field whose total Levels equal or exceed the Level of the Ritual Monster you Ritual Summon. If you control an "@Ignister" monster when this effect is activated, you can also use "@Ignister" monster(s) in your GY, by banishing them.', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/85327820.jpg', '2021 Tin of Ancient Battles', 'MP21-EN025', 'https://ygoprodeck.com/card/a-i-s-ritual-10593'),
  ('yugioh', '54374642', 'A.I.''s Show', 'Trap Card', 'Ultra Rare', 'While you control a Link-3 or higher "@Ignister" monster in the Extra Monster Zone, when an opponent''s monster declares an attack: Special Summon from your Extra Deck any number of non-Link Cyberse monster(s) with 2300 ATK, whose combined ATK is less than or equal to the attacking monster''s ATK, then end the Battle Phase.', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/54374642.jpg', 'Brothers of Legend', 'BROL-EN042', 'https://ygoprodeck.com/card/a-i-s-show-12263'),
  ('yugioh', '22933016', 'A.I.dle Reborn', 'Spell Card', 'Common', 'Target 1 "@Ignister" monster in your GY; Special Summon it, also you cannot Special Summon monsters for the rest of this turn after this card resolves, except Cyberse monsters. When an attack is declared involving 2 monsters: You can banish this card from your GY and 1 card from your hand, then target 1 of your "A.I." Spells/Traps that is banished or in your GY, except "A.I.dle Reborn"; add that card to your hand. You can only use each effect of "A.I.dle Reborn" once per turn.', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/22933016.jpg', '2021 Tin of Ancient Battles', 'MP21-EN023', 'https://ygoprodeck.com/card/a-i-dle-reborn-10592'),
  ('yugioh', '69381150', 'A.I.Q', 'Trap Card', 'Common', 'Activate only if you control an "@Ignister" monster. Once per turn, during your Standby Phase, Tribute 1 Link Monster, or destroy this card. Each player can only Link Summon a monster once per turn while this card is face-up on the field.', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/69381150.jpg', '2021 Tin of Ancient Battles', 'MP21-EN083', 'https://ygoprodeck.com/card/a-i-q-10725'),
