  ('yugioh', '89801755', 'Abyssal Designator', 'Spell Card', 'Common', 'Pay 1000 Life Points. Declare a Type and an Attribute. Your opponent must send 1 monster with both the declared Type and Attribute from their hand or Deck to the Graveyard.', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/89801755.jpg', 'Dark Revelation Volume 3', 'DR3-EN040', 'https://ygoprodeck.com/card/abyssal-designator-7504'),
  ('yugioh', '44223284', 'Abyssal Kingshark', 'Effect Monster', 'Common', 'Once per turn, if this card would be destroyed by an effect that does not target it, it is not destroyed.', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/44223284.jpg', 'Battle Pack: Epic Dawn', 'BP01-EN155', 'https://ygoprodeck.com/card/abyssal-kingshark-3772'),
  ('yugioh', '17080584', 'Abyssrhine, the Atlantean Spirit', 'Effect Monster', 'Ultra Rare', '(This card is always treated as a "Mermail" card.)
