  ('yugioh', '62476197', 'Achacha Chanbara', 'Effect Monster', 'Common', 'During either player''s turn, when a card or effect is activated that will inflict damage when it resolves: You can Special Summon this card from your hand, and if you do, inflict 400 damage to your opponent.', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/62476197.jpg', 'Abyss Rising', 'ABYR-EN003', 'https://ygoprodeck.com/card/achacha-chanbara-5283'),
  ('yugioh', '15808381', 'Achichi @Ignister', 'Effect Monster', 'Ultra Rare', 'If this card is Normal or Special Summoned: You can add 1 Level 4 or lower "@Ignister" monster from your Deck to your hand, except "Achichi @Ignister". At the start of the Damage Step, when your Cyberse monster battles: You can banish this card from your GY; destroy that monster you control. You can only use each effect of "Achichi @Ignister" once per turn.', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/15808381.jpg', '2021 Tin of Ancient Battles', 'MP21-EN003', 'https://ygoprodeck.com/card/achichi-ignister-10585'),
