  ('yugioh', '46358784', 'Advanced Crystal Beast Emerald Tortoise', 'Effect Monster', 'Secret Rare', 'If "Advanced Dark" is not in a Field Zone, send this monster to the GY. Once per turn (Quick Effect): You can target 1 face-up monster on the field; change its battle position. If this face-up card is destroyed in a Monster Zone, you can place it face-up in your Spell & Trap Zone as a Continuous Spell, instead of sending it to the GY.', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/46358784.jpg', 'Battles of Legend: Crystal Revenge', 'BLCR-EN012', 'https://ygoprodeck.com/card/advanced-crystal-beast-emerald-tortoise-13307'),
