  ('yugioh', '38331244', 'Akasuna the Battle Ashtra', 'Effect Monster', 'Secret Rare', 'You can Special Summon this card (from your hand) by revealing 1 face-down card you control and returning it to the hand or Extra Deck. You can only Special Summon "Akasuna the Battle Ashtra" once per turn this way. You can only use each of the following effects of "Akasuna the Battle Ashtra" once per turn. During the Main Phase (Quick Effect): You can send 1 Trap from your hand or face-down field to the GY; change all face-up monsters your opponent controls to face-down Defense Position. During your End Phase: You can Set 1 "Ashtra" Trap from your Deck.', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/38331244.jpg', 'Beyond the Brave', 'BETB-EN009', 'https://ygoprodeck.com/card/akasuna-the-battle-ashtra-15793'),
  ('yugioh', '38837163', 'Akz, the Pumer', 'Effect Monster', 'Rare', 'This card cannot be Normal Summoned or Set. This card can only be Special Summoned by removing from play 2 Beast-Warrior-Type monsters in your Graveyard. Once per turn, you can discard 1 Beast-Warrior-Type monster to activate 1 of the following effects: ● Double this card''s ATK until the End Phase. ● This card can attack your opponent directly this turn.', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/38837163.jpg', 'The Shining Darkness', 'TSHD-EN085', 'https://ygoprodeck.com/card/akz-the-pumer-3292'),
  ('yugioh', '25795273', 'Al-Lumi''raj', 'Tuner Monster', 'Common', 'All monsters on the field lose ATK and DEF equal to their own Level/Rank x 300.', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/25795273.jpg', '2016 Mega-Tin Mega Pack', 'MP16-EN204', 'https://ygoprodeck.com/card/al-lumi-raj-2221'),
