  ('yugioh', '25451383', 'Albion the Shrouded Dragon', 'Effect Monster', 'Common', 'This card''s name becomes "Fallen of Albaz" while on the field or in the GY. If this card is in your hand or GY: You can send 1 "Fallen of Albaz" or 1 "Branded" Spell/Trap from your hand or Deck to the GY; apply the following effect based on where you sent it from.
