  ('yugioh', '78121572', 'Alchemist of Black Spells', 'Effect Monster', 'Ultimate Rare', 'Once per turn, you can change this face-up Attack Position card you control to face-up Defense Position and place 1 Spell Counter on a face-up card you control that you can place a Spell Counter on.', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/78121572.jpg', 'Absolute Powerforce', 'ABPF-EN082', 'https://ygoprodeck.com/card/alchemist-of-black-spells-6567'),
