  ('yugioh', '17573739', 'Alector, Sovereign of Birds', 'Effect Monster', 'Common', 'If your opponent controls 2 or more face-up monsters of the same Attribute, you can Special Summon this card (from your hand). Once per turn: You can target 1 face-up card on the field; that target''s effects are negated during this turn. There can only be 1 face-up "Alector, Sovereign of Birds" on the field.', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/17573739.jpg', 'Battle Pack: Epic Dawn', 'BP01-EN153', 'https://ygoprodeck.com/card/alector-sovereign-of-birds-1528'),
