  ('yugioh', '86120751', 'Aleister the Invoker', 'Effect Monster', 'Super Rare', '(Quick Effect): You can send this card from your hand to the GY, then target 1 Fusion Monster you control; it gains 1000 ATK/DEF until the end of this turn. If this card is Normal Summoned or flipped face-up: You can add 1 "Invocation" from your Deck to your hand.', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/86120751.jpg', 'Fusion Enforcers', 'FUEN-EN026', 'https://ygoprodeck.com/card/aleister-the-invoker-7213'),
  ('yugioh', '97973962', 'Aleister the Invoker of Madness', 'Link Monster', 'Collector''s Rare', '2 monsters with different Types and different Attributes
