  ('yugioh', '45154513', 'Alghoul Mazera', 'Effect Monster', 'Common', 'If a Zombie monster(s) you control would be destroyed by battle or card effect, you can banish this card from your hand or GY instead. If this card is banished from the hand or GY: You can Special Summon this card in Defense Position, then you can reduce its Level by 1. You can only use each effect of "Alghoul Mazera" once per turn.', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/45154513.jpg', 'Dimension Force', 'DIFO-EN014', 'https://ygoprodeck.com/card/alghoul-mazera-12960'),
  ('yugioh', '14504454', 'Alice, Lady of Lament', 'Effect Monster', 'Super Rare', 'When this card is Normal Summoned: You can target 1 "Lady of Lament" monster in your GY; Special Summon it. You can only use each of the following effects of "Alice, Lady of Lament" once per turn. You can banish 1 Trap from your hand or GY; Special Summon this card from your hand. If this card is Tributed, or if this card in its owner''s possession is destroyed by an opponent''s card: You can add 1 Fiend monster whose combined ATK & DEF equal 2000 from your Deck to your hand, except "Alice, Lady of Lament".', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/14504454.jpg', 'Battle of Chaos', 'BACH-EN028', 'https://ygoprodeck.com/card/alice-lady-of-lament-12765'),
