  ('yugioh', '15475415', 'Alien Dog', 'Effect Monster', 'Common', 'When you Normal Summon an "Alien" monster, you can Special Summon this card from your hand. When you do, place 2 A-Counters on face-up monster(s) your opponent controls.', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/15475415.jpg', 'Raging Battle', 'RGBT-EN033', 'https://ygoprodeck.com/card/alien-dog-1331'),
