  ('yugioh', '38468214', 'Alien Hypno', 'Gemini Monster', 'Common', 'This card is treated as a Normal Monster while face-up on the field or in the Graveyard. While this card is face-up on the field, you can Normal Summon it to have it be treated as an Effect Monster with this effect:
