  ('yugioh', '42023223', 'Alpha The Electromagnet Warrior', 'Effect Monster', 'Rare', 'If this card is Normal or Special Summoned: You can add 1 Level 8 "Magna Warrior" monster from your Deck to your hand. You can only use this effect of "Alpha The Electromagnet Warrior" once per turn. During your opponent''s turn (Quick Effect): You can Tribute this card; Special Summon 1 Level 4 "Magnet Warrior" monster from your Deck.', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/42023223.jpg', 'Maze of Muertos', 'MZMU-EN080', 'https://ygoprodeck.com/card/alpha-the-electromagnet-warrior-3584'),
  ('yugioh', '99785935', 'Alpha The Magnet Warrior', 'Normal Monster', 'Common', '''''Alpha, Beta, and Gamma meld as one to form a powerful monster.''''', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/99785935.jpg', 'Legendary Collection 3: Yugi''s World Mega Pack', 'LCYW-EN012', 'https://ygoprodeck.com/card/alpha-the-magnet-warrior-8284'),
  ('yugioh', '73304257', 'Alpha, the Master of Beasts', 'Effect Monster', 'Ultra Rare', 'Cannot be Normal Summoned/Set. Must first be Special Summoned (from your hand) while the total ATK of all monsters your opponent controls is more than that of all monsters you control. You can target any number of Beast, Beast-Warrior, and/or Winged Beast monsters you control; return them to the hand, then, return face-up monsters your opponent controls to the hand, equal to the number of cards you returned to the hand, also for the rest of this turn, "Alpha, the Master of Beasts" you control cannot attack directly. You can only use this effect of "Alpha, the Master of Beasts" once per turn.', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/73304257.jpg', '2021 Tin of Ancient Battles', 'MP21-EN179', 'https://ygoprodeck.com/card/alpha-the-master-of-beasts-11398'),
  ('yugioh', '10406322', 'Alsei, the Sylvan High Protector', 'XYZ Monster', 'Ultra Rare', '2 Level 8 monsters
