  ('yugioh', '86885905', 'Altergeist Emulatelf', 'Trap Card', 'Common', 'Special Summon this card as an Effect Monster (Spellcaster/LIGHT/Level 4/ATK 1400/DEF 1800). (This card is also still a Trap.) If Summoned this way, while it is in the Monster Zone, other "Altergeist" Traps you control cannot be destroyed by card effects, also neither player can target them with card effects.', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/86885905.jpg', '2019 Gold Sarcophagus Tin Mega Pack', 'MP19-EN047', 'https://ygoprodeck.com/card/altergeist-emulatelf-9261'),
  ('yugioh', '98753320', 'Altergeist Failover', 'Trap Card', 'Ultra Rare', 'If another card(s) you control is destroyed by an opponent''s card effect (except during the Damage Step): You can Special Summon 1 "Altergeist" monster from your hand. You can banish this card from your GY, then target 1 "Altergeist" monster in your GY; add it to your hand. You can only use each effect of "Altergeist Failover" once per turn.', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/98753320.jpg', 'Ghosts From the Past: The 2nd Haunting', 'GFP2-EN027', 'https://ygoprodeck.com/card/altergeist-failover-10513'),
  ('yugioh', '12977245', 'Altergeist Fifinellag', 'Tuner Monster', 'Common', 'Monsters your opponent controls cannot target "Altergeist" monsters you control for attacks, except "Altergeist Fifinellag", also your opponent cannot target "Altergeist" monsters you control with card effects, except "Altergeist Fifinellag".', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/12977245.jpg', 'Dark Neostorm', 'DANE-EN005', 'https://ygoprodeck.com/card/altergeist-fifinellag-9967'),
  ('yugioh', '85673903', 'Altergeist Fijialert', 'Effect Monster', 'Secret Rare', 'When an "Altergeist" Link Monster is Link Summoned to your field (except during the Damage Step): You can target 1 other Link Monster on the field; Special Summon this card from your hand to your zone that target points to, also, for the rest of this turn, that monster is also treated as an "Altergeist" monster. You can only use this effect of "Altergeist Fijialert" once per turn.', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/85673903.jpg', 'Brothers of Legend', 'BROL-EN047', 'https://ygoprodeck.com/card/altergeist-fijialert-10795'),
  ('yugioh', '2547033', 'Altergeist Haunted Rock', 'Trap Card', 'Common', 'If this card was Set by the effect of an "Altergeist" card, you can activate it the turn it was Set. When this card is activated: Send 1 "Altergeist" monster from your hand to the GY. When your opponent activates a Trap Card (except during the Damage Step): You can send 1 "Altergeist" monster from your hand to the GY; negate that effect, and if you do, destroy that card. You can only use each effect of "Altergeist Haunted Rock" once per turn.', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/2547033.jpg', 'Dark Neostorm', 'DANE-EN068', 'https://ygoprodeck.com/card/altergeist-haunted-rock-10024'),
  ('yugioh', '1508649', 'Altergeist Hexstia', 'Link Monster', 'Super Rare', '2 "Altergeist" monsters
