  ('yugioh', '52927340', 'Altergeist Kunquery', 'Effect Monster', 'Common', 'When an opponent''s monster declares an attack, if you control an "Altergeist" card: You can Special Summon this card from your hand, and if you do, negate that attack. If this card is Special Summoned: You can target 1 face-up card your opponent controls; negate the effects of that card while it and this monster are face-up on the field.', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/52927340.jpg', '2018 Mega-Tin Mega Pack', 'MP18-EN116', 'https://ygoprodeck.com/card/altergeist-kunquery-8909'),
  ('yugioh', '27132400', 'Altergeist Malwisp', 'Tuner Monster', 'Super Rare', 'If this card is added to your hand, except by drawing it: You can Special Summon it. If this card is Normal or Special Summoned: You can target 1 "Altergeist" monster in your GY, except "Altergeist Malwisp"; Special Summon it in Defense Position, but for the rest of this turn, it cannot activate its effects. You can only use each effect of "Altergeist Malwisp" once per turn.', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/27132400.jpg', 'Duelist Nexus', 'DUNE-EN009', 'https://ygoprodeck.com/card/altergeist-malwisp-13868'),
