  ('yugioh', '25533642', 'Altergeist Meluseek', 'Effect Monster', 'Ultra Rare', 'This card can attack directly. When this card inflicts battle damage to your opponent: You can target 1 card your opponent controls; send it to the GY. If this card is sent from the field to the GY: You can add 1 "Altergeist" monster from your Deck to your hand, except "Altergeist Meluseek". You can only use this effect of "Altergeist Meluseek" once per turn.', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/25533642.jpg', '2018 Mega-Tin Mega Pack', 'MP18-EN115', 'https://ygoprodeck.com/card/altergeist-meluseek-8621'),
