  ('yugioh', '42790071', 'Altergeist Multifaker', 'Effect Monster', 'Prismatic Secret Rare', 'If you activate a Trap Card (except during the Damage Step): You can Special Summon this card from your hand. If this card is Special Summoned: You can Special Summon 1 "Altergeist" monster from your Deck in Defense Position, except "Altergeist Multifaker". You cannot Special Summon monsters the turn you activate this effect, except "Altergeist" monsters. You can only use each effect of "Altergeist Multifaker" once per turn.', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/42790071.jpg', '2019 Gold Sarcophagus Tin Mega Pack', 'MP19-EN009', 'https://ygoprodeck.com/card/altergeist-multifaker-9255'),
  ('yugioh', '54126514', 'Altergeist Peritrator', 'Effect Monster', 'Super Rare', 'This card can attack directly. You can only use each of the following effects of "Altergeist Peritrator" once per turn. When this card inflicts battle damage to your opponent: You can draw 1 card. If this card is sent from the field to the GY: You can send 1 "Altergeist" card from your hand, Deck, or face-up field to the GY, except "Altergeist Peritrator".', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/54126514.jpg', 'Duelist Nexus', 'DUNE-EN010', 'https://ygoprodeck.com/card/altergeist-peritrator-13869'),
