  ('yugioh', '55262310', 'Amaze Attraction Rapid Racing', 'Trap Card', 'Common', 'Target 1 "Amazement" monster you control or 1 face-up monster your opponent controls; equip this card to it. You can activate the following effect, based on which player controls the equipped monster;
