  ('yugioh', '36591747', 'Amaze Attraction Thrill Train', 'Trap Card', 'Common', 'Target 1 "Amazement" monster you control or 1 face-up monster your opponent controls; equip this card to it. You can activate the following effect, based on which player controls the equipped monster;
