  ('yugioh', '10928224', 'Amazoness Baby Tiger', 'Effect Monster', 'Ultra Rare', 'This card''s name becomes "Amazoness Tiger" while on the field or in the GY. If an "Amazoness" monster is Normal or Special Summoned to your field while this card is in your hand or GY: You can Special Summon this card. You can only use this effect of "Amazoness Baby Tiger" once per turn. Gains 100 ATK for each "Amazoness" card in your GY.', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/10928224.jpg', 'Legendary Duelists', 'LEDU-EN009', 'https://ygoprodeck.com/card/amazoness-baby-tiger-8497'),
  ('yugioh', '73574678', 'Amazoness Blowpiper', 'Effect Monster', 'Common', 'Select 1 face-up monster your opponent controls during each of your Standby Phases. It loses 500 ATK until the end of this turn.', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/73574678.jpg', 'Dark Revelation Volume 1', 'DR1-EN117', 'https://ygoprodeck.com/card/amazoness-blowpiper-6175'),
  ('yugioh', '57312333', 'Amazoness Call', 'Spell Card', 'Rare', 'Take 1 "Amazoness" card from your Deck, except "Amazoness Call", and either add it to your hand or send it to the GY. During your Main Phase: You can banish this card from your GY, then target 1 "Amazoness" monster you control; this turn, that monster can attack all monsters your opponent controls, once each, also other monsters you control cannot attack. You can only activate 1 "Amazoness Call" per turn.', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/57312333.jpg', 'Legendary Duelists', 'LEDU-EN010', 'https://ygoprodeck.com/card/amazoness-call-8499'),
  ('yugioh', '29654737', 'Amazoness Chain Master', 'Effect Monster', 'Rare', 'When this card is destroyed by battle and sent to the GY: You can pay 1500 LP; look at your opponent''s hand, then add 1 monster from their hand to your hand.', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/29654737.jpg', 'Dark Legends', 'DLG1-EN098', 'https://ygoprodeck.com/card/amazoness-chain-master-2512'),
  ('yugioh', '4591250', 'Amazoness Empress', 'Fusion Monster', 'Common', '"Amazoness Queen" + 1 "Amazoness" monster
