  ('yugioh', '25396150', 'Amazoness Hall', 'Trap Card', 'Ultra Rare', 'When this card is activated: You can take 1 "Amazoness" monster from your GY or your face-up Extra Deck, and either add it to your hand or (if it is a Pendulum Monster) place it in your Pendulum Zone. If a monster(s) is Special Summoned to your opponent''s field while you control an "Amazoness" Monster Card (except during the Damage Step): You can target 1 of those opponent''s monsters; gain LP equal to its ATK. You can only use this effect of "Amazoness Hall" once per turn.', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/25396150.jpg', 'Battles of Legend: Crystal Revenge', 'BLCR-EN038', 'https://ygoprodeck.com/card/amazoness-hall-13311'),
