  ('yugioh', '83104731', 'Ancient Gear Golem', 'Effect Monster', 'Mosaic Rare', 'Cannot be Special Summoned. If this card attacks, your opponent cannot activate any Spell/Trap Cards until the end of the Damage Step. If this card attacks a Defense Position monster, inflict piercing battle damage.', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/83104731.jpg', 'Battle Pack 2: War of the Giants', 'BP02-EN035', 'https://ygoprodeck.com/card/ancient-gear-golem-6977'),
