  ('yugioh', '33545259', 'Ancient Warriors - Ambitious Cao De', 'Effect Monster', 'Super Rare', 'While you control another "Ancient Warriors" monster, your opponent cannot target this card with card effects, also it cannot be destroyed by your opponent''s card effects. You can only use each of the following effects of "Ancient Warriors - Ambitious Cao De" once per turn.
