  ('yugioh', '6438003', 'Ancient Warriors - Deceptive Jia Wen', 'Effect Monster', 'Common', 'You can target 1 Continuous Spell/Trap you control; send it to the GY, and if you do, halve the ATK of 2 face-up monsters on the field, until the end of this turn. If a card(s) your opponent controls is destroyed by battle or card effect: You can target 1 "Ancient Warriors" card in your GY, except "Ancient Warriors - Deceptive Jia Wen"; add it to your hand. You can only use each effect of "Ancient Warriors - Deceptive Jia Wen" once per turn.', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/6438003.jpg', 'Eternity Code', 'ETCO-EN022', 'https://ygoprodeck.com/card/ancient-warriors-deceptive-jia-wen-10772'),
  ('yugioh', '13923256', 'Ancient Warriors - Eccentric Lu Jing', 'Effect Monster', 'Rare', 'You can target 1 Continuous Spell/Trap you control; send it to the GY, and if you do, add 1 "Ancient Warriors" Spell/Trap with a different name from your GY to your hand. If your other "Ancient Warriors" monster''s effect is activated (except during the Damage Step): You can target 1 Spell/Trap your opponent controls; destroy it. You can only use each effect of "Ancient Warriors - Eccentric Lu Jing" once per turn.', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/13923256.jpg', 'Ignition Assault', 'IGAS-EN010', 'https://ygoprodeck.com/card/ancient-warriors-eccentric-lu-jing-10619'),
  ('yugioh', '60033398', 'Ancient Warriors - Fearsome Zhang Yuan', 'Effect Monster', 'Common', 'All other "Ancient Warriors" monsters you control cannot be destroyed by battle. You can only use each of the following effects of "Ancient Warriors - Fearsome Zhang Yuan" once per turn.
