  ('yugioh', '77539547', 'Ancient Warriors - Graceful Zhou Gong', 'Effect Monster', 'Rare', 'You can target 1 Continuous Spell/Trap you control; send it to the GY, and if you do, add 1 "Ancient Warriors" Spell/Trap from your Deck to your hand. If your other "Ancient Warriors" monster''s effect is activated (except during the Damage Step): You can target 1 Effect Monster your opponent controls; negate its effects until the end of this turn. You can only use each effect of "Ancient Warriors - Graceful Zhou Gong" once per turn.', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/77539547.jpg', 'Ignition Assault', 'IGAS-EN009', 'https://ygoprodeck.com/card/ancient-warriors-graceful-zhou-gong-10614'),
  ('yugioh', '32422602', 'Ancient Warriors - Ingenious Zhuge Kong', 'Effect Monster', 'Super Rare', 'If this card is added from the Deck to your hand by the effect of an "Ancient Warriors" card: You can Special Summon it. When a Spell/Trap Card is activated (Quick Effect): You can send 1 face-up "Ancient Warriors" Continuous Spell/Trap you control to the GY; negate the activation. When a monster effect is activated while you control "Ancient Warriors - Virtuous Liu Xuan" (Quick Effect): You can send 1 face-up "Ancient Warriors" Continuous Spell/Trap you control to the GY; negate the activation. You can only use each effect of "Ancient Warriors - Ingenious Zhuge Kong" once per turn.', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/32422602.jpg', 'Eternity Code', 'ETCO-EN023', 'https://ygoprodeck.com/card/ancient-warriors-ingenious-zhuge-kong-10771'),
  ('yugioh', '76416959', 'Ancient Warriors - Loyal Guan Yun', 'Effect Monster', 'Super Rare', 'If only your opponent controls a monster: You can Special Summon this card from your hand. Your opponent cannot target other "Ancient Warriors" monsters you control with card effects. If your opponent controls more monsters than you do: You can target 1 monster your opponent controls; destroy it. You can only use this effect of "Ancient Warriors - Loyal Guan Yun" once per turn.', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/76416959.jpg', 'Ignition Assault', 'IGAS-EN012', 'https://ygoprodeck.com/card/ancient-warriors-loyal-guan-yun-10617'),
  ('yugioh', '40140448', 'Ancient Warriors - Masterful Sun Mou', 'Effect Monster', 'Ultra Rare', 'While you control another "Ancient Warriors" monster, your opponent''s monsters cannot target this card for attacks. You can only use each of the following effects of "Ancient Warriors - Masterful Sun Mou" once per turn.
