  ('yugioh', '40428851', 'Ancient Warriors - Virtuous Liu Xuan', 'Effect Monster', 'Ultra Rare', 'While you control another "Ancient Warriors" monster, your opponent''s monsters cannot target this card for attacks. You can only use each of the following effects of "Ancient Warriors - Virtuous Liu Xuan" once per turn.
