  ('yugioh', '4810585', 'Ancient Warriors Saga - Defense of Changban', 'Trap Card', 'Rare', 'If your "Ancient Warriors" monster battles, your opponent cannot activate any Spell/Trap Cards until the end of the Damage Step. You can only use 1 of the following effects of "Ancient Warriors Saga - Defense of Changban" per turn, and only once that turn.
