  ('yugioh', '15013468', 'Andro Sphinx', 'Effect Monster', 'Ultra Rare', 'You can pay 500 Life Points to Special Summon this card when "Pyramid of Light" is on the field. This card cannot attack during the turn that it is Normal Summoned or Special Summoned. This card cannot be Special Summoned from the Graveyard. If this card destroys a Defense Position monster as a result of battle, inflict damage to your opponent''s Life Points equal to half of the ATK of the destroyed monster.', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/15013468.jpg', 'Exclusive Pack', 'EP1-EN002', 'https://ygoprodeck.com/card/andro-sphinx-1287'),
  ('yugioh', '53266486', 'Anesthrokket Dragon', 'Effect Monster', 'Common', 'When a Link Monster''s effect is activated that targets this face-up card on the field (Quick Effect): You can destroy this card, then make 1 face-up monster on the field unable to attack, also it has its effects negated. During the End Phase, if this card is in the GY because it was destroyed on the field by battle or card effect and sent there this turn: You can Special Summon 1 "Rokket" monster from your Deck, except "Anesthrokket Dragon". You can only use each effect of "Anesthrokket Dragon" once per turn.', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/53266486.jpg', '2018 Mega-Tin Mega Pack', 'MP18-EN110', 'https://ygoprodeck.com/card/anesthrokket-dragon-8763'),
  ('yugioh', '82243738', 'Angel O1', 'Effect Monster', 'Super Rare', 'You can Special Summon this card (from your hand) by revealing 1 Level 7 or higher monster from your hand. You can only Special Summon "Angel O1" once per turn this way. While you control this Special Summoned card, you can Tribute Summon 1 Level 7 or higher monster in Attack Position during your Main Phase, in addition to your Normal Summon/Set. (You can only gain this effect once per turn.)', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/82243738.jpg', 'Egyptian God Deck: Obelisk the Tormentor', 'EGO1-EN006', 'https://ygoprodeck.com/card/angel-o1-11753'),
  ('yugioh', '56784842', 'Angel O7', 'Effect Monster', 'Secret Rare', 'When this card is Tribute Summoned, it gains the following effect: ● The effects of Effect Monsters cannot be activated.', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/56784842.jpg', 'Light of Destruction', 'LODT-EN092', 'https://ygoprodeck.com/card/angel-o7-4837'),
  ('yugioh', '91706817', 'Angel of Blue Tears', 'Spell Card', 'Ultra Rare', 'Target 1 face-up monster on the field; its controller''s opponent takes damage equal to the number of cards in their hand x 200, then negate that target''s effects until the end of this turn. If effect damage is inflicted (except during the Damage Step): You can banish this card from your GY; Set 1 Normal Trap directly from your hand or Deck. If Set from the hand, it can be activated this turn. You can only use 1 "Angel of Blue Tears" effect per turn, and only once that turn.', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/91706817.jpg', '25th Anniversary Tin: Dueling Mirrors', 'MP24-EN269', 'https://ygoprodeck.com/card/angel-of-blue-tears-13066'),
  ('yugioh', '42216237', 'Angel of Zera', 'Synchro Monster', 'Secret Rare', '1 Tuner + 1 or more non-Tuner monsters
