  ('yugioh', '59062857', 'Angelechy Brilliant Move', 'Spell Card', 'Super Rare', 'Return 1 "Angelechy" Monster Card you own from your Spell & Trap Zone to the Extra Deck, then you can Special Summon it. You can banish this card from your GY, then send 1 "Angelechy" card from your hand or face-up field to the GY; Special Summon 1 "Angelechy" monster from your Extra Deck. You can only use each effect of "Angelechy Brilliant Move" once per turn.', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/59062857.jpg', 'Beyond the Brave', 'BETB-EN093', 'https://ygoprodeck.com/card/angelechy-brilliant-move-15981'),
  ('yugioh', '50284408', 'Angelechy Castellan', 'Synchro Monster', 'Ultra Rare', '1 Tuner + 1+ non-Tuners
