  ('yugioh', '54171327', 'Angelechy Disturbance', 'Trap Card', 'Common', 'Give control of 1 "Angelechy" monster you control to your opponent (until the End Phase), then if your opponent controls a face-up card(s) in its adjacent Monster Zones and/or Spell & Trap Zones, their effects are negated. You can banish this card from your GY; add 1 "Angelechy" Spell/Trap from your Deck to your hand, except "Angelechy Disturbance". You can only use each effect of "Angelechy Disturbance" once per turn.', 'https://images.ygoprodeck.com/images/cards/54171327.jpg', 'Chaos Origins', 'CORI-EN095', 'https://ygoprodeck.com/card/angelechy-disturbance-15801'),
  ('yugioh', '12845564', 'Angelechy Endgame Problem', 'Spell Card', 'Common', 'This card gains the following effects, based on the number of "Angelechy" Monster Cards in your Spell & Trap Zone.
● 1+: Once per turn, during your opponent''s Standby Phase: You can draw 1 card.
