  ('onepiece', 'OP-08:OP08-100', 'South Bird', 'Character', 'UC', '[On Play] Look at 7 cards from the top of your deck and play up to 1 [Upper Yard]. Then, place the rest at the bottom of your deck in any order.', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/media/static/Card_Images/OP08-100.jpg', 'Two Legends', 'OP-08', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/api/sets/card/OP08-100/'),
  ('onepiece', 'OP-08:OP08-038', 'We Would Never Sell a Comrade to an Enemy!!!', 'Event', 'C', '[Main] You may rest 2 of your Characters: None of your Characters can be K.O.''d by your opponent''s effects until the end of your opponent''s next turn. [Trigger] Rest up to 1 of your opponent''s Characters with a cost of 3 or less.', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/media/static/Card_Images/OP08-038.jpg', 'Two Legends', 'OP-08', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/api/sets/card/OP08-038/'),
  ('onepiece', 'OP-08:OP08-025', 'Shishilian', 'Character', 'C', '[On Play] Up to 1 of your opponent''s rested Characters with a cost of 3 or less will not become active in your opponent''s next Refresh Phase.', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/media/static/Card_Images/OP08-025.jpg', 'Two Legends', 'OP-08', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/api/sets/card/OP08-025/'),
