  ('onepiece', 'EB-02:EB02-054_p1', 'Sanji (Alternate Art)', 'Character', 'R', '[Blocker] (After your opponent declares an attack, you may rest this card to make it the new target of the attack.)[On Play] If you have 2 or less Life cards, draw 2 cards and trash 1 card from your hand.', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/media/static/Card_Images/EB02-054_p1.jpg', 'Extra Booster: Anime 25th Collection', 'EB-02', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/api/sets/card/EB02-054/'),
  ('onepiece', 'EB-02:EB02-047', 'Blueno', 'Character', 'C', '[Activate: Main] You may trash 1 card from your hand and trash this Character: Play up to 1 Character card with a type including "CP" and a cost of 5 or less other than [Blueno] from your trash.', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/media/static/Card_Images/EB02-047.jpg', 'Extra Booster: Anime 25th Collection', 'EB-02', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/api/sets/card/EB02-047/'),
  ('onepiece', 'EB-02:EB02-010_p1', 'Monkey.D.Luffy (010) (Alternate Art)', 'Leader', 'L', '[Activate: Main] [Once Per Turn] DON!! 2: If the only Characters on your field are "Straw Hat Crew" type Characters, set up to 2 of your DON!! cards as active. Then, this Leader gains +1000 power until the end of your opponent''s next turn.', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/media/static/Card_Images/EB02-010_p1.jpg', 'Extra Booster: Anime 25th Collection', 'EB-02', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/api/sets/card/EB02-010/'),
  ('onepiece', 'EB-02:EB02-061_p2', 'Monkey.D.Luffy (061) (Manga)', 'Character', 'SEC', 'If your Leader is multicolored and your opponent has 5 or more DON!! cards on their field, this Character gains [Rush].[When Attacking] [Once Per Turn] You may return 2 of your active DON!! cards to your DON!! deck: Set this Character as active. Then, add 1 card from the top of your Life cards to your hand.', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/media/static/Card_Images/EB02-061_p2.jpg', 'Extra Booster: Anime 25th Collection', 'EB-02', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/api/sets/card/EB02-061/'),
  ('onepiece', 'EB-02:OP05-002_p2', 'Belo Betty (SPR)', 'Leader', 'L', '[Activate: Main] [Once Per Turn] You may trash 1 "Revolutionary Army" type card from your hand: Up to 3 of your "Revolutionary Army" type Characters or Characters with a [Trigger] gain +3000 power during this turn.', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/media/static/Card_Images/OP05-002_p2.jpg', 'Extra Booster: Anime 25th Collection', 'EB-02', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/api/sets/card/OP05-002/'),
  ('onepiece', 'EB-02:OP06-042_p2', 'Vinsmoke Reiju (SPR)', 'Leader', 'L', '[Your Turn] [Once Per Turn] When a DON!! card on your field is returned to your DON!! deck, draw 1 card.', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/media/static/Card_Images/OP06-042_p2.jpg', 'Extra Booster: Anime 25th Collection', 'EB-02', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/api/sets/card/OP06-042/'),
  ('onepiece', 'EB-02:OP05-022_p2', 'Donquixote Rosinante (SPR)', 'Leader', 'L', '[Blocker] (After your opponent declares an attack, you may rest this card to make it the new target of the attack.)[End of Your Turn] If you have 6 or less cards in your hand, set this Leader as active.', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/media/static/Card_Images/OP05-022_p2.jpg', 'Extra Booster: Anime 25th Collection', 'EB-02', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/api/sets/card/OP05-022/'),
  ('onepiece', 'EB-02:OP08-058_p2', 'Charlotte Pudding (SPR)', 'Leader', 'L', '[When Attacking] You may turn 2 cards from the top of your Life cards face-up: Add up to 1 DON!! card from your DON!! deck and rest it.', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/media/static/Card_Images/OP08-058_p2.jpg', 'Extra Booster: Anime 25th Collection', 'EB-02', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/api/sets/card/OP08-058/'),
  ('onepiece', 'EB-02:OP06-022_p2', 'Yamato (SPR)', 'Leader', 'L', '[Double Attack] (This card deals 2 damage.)[Activate: Main] [Once Per Turn] If your opponent has 3 or less Life cards, give up to 2 rested DON!! cards to 1 of your Characters.', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/media/static/Card_Images/OP06-022_p2.jpg', 'Extra Booster: Anime 25th Collection', 'EB-02', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/api/sets/card/OP06-022/'),
  ('onepiece', 'EB-02:OP08-021_p2', 'Carrot (SPR)', 'Leader', 'L', '[Activate: Main] [Once Per Turn] If you have a "Minks" type Character, rest up to 1 of your opponent''s Characters with a cost of 5 or less.', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/media/static/Card_Images/OP08-021_p2.jpg', 'Extra Booster: Anime 25th Collection', 'EB-02', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/api/sets/card/OP08-021/'),
  ('onepiece', 'EB-02:OP05-001_p2', 'Sabo (SPR)', 'Leader', 'L', '[DON!! x1] [Opponent''s Turn] [Once Per Turn] If your Character with 5000 power or more would be K.O.''d, you may give that Character 1000 power during this turn instead of that Character being K.O.''d.', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/media/static/Card_Images/OP05-001_p2.jpg', 'Extra Booster: Anime 25th Collection', 'EB-02', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/api/sets/card/OP05-001/'),
  ('onepiece', 'EB-02:OP07-019_p2', 'Jewelry Bonney (SPR)', 'Leader', 'L', '[On Your Opponent''s Attack] [Once Per Turn] 1 (You may rest the specified number of DON!! cards in your cost area.): Rest up to 1 of your opponent''s Leader or Character cards.', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/media/static/Card_Images/OP07-019_p2.jpg', 'Extra Booster: Anime 25th Collection', 'EB-02', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/api/sets/card/OP07-019/'),
  ('onepiece', 'EB-02:OP07-001_p2', 'Monkey.D.Dragon (SPR)', 'Leader', 'L', '[Activate: Main] [Once Per Turn] Give up to 2 total of your currently given DON!! cards to 1 of your Characters.', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/media/static/Card_Images/OP07-001_p2.jpg', 'Extra Booster: Anime 25th Collection', 'EB-02', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/api/sets/card/OP07-001/'),
  ('onepiece', 'EB-02:OP08-002_p2', 'Marco (SPR)', 'Leader', 'L', '[DON!! x1] [Activate: Main] [Once Per Turn] Draw 1 card and place 1 card from your hand at the top or bottom of your deck. Then, give up to 1 of your opponent''s Characters 2000 power during this turn.', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/media/static/Card_Images/OP08-002_p2.jpg', 'Extra Booster: Anime 25th Collection', 'EB-02', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/api/sets/card/OP08-002/'),
  ('onepiece', 'EB-02:OP06-021_p2', 'Perona (SPR)', 'Leader', 'L', '[Activate: Main] [Once Per Turn] Choose one:• Rest up to 1 of your opponent''s Characters with a cost of 4 or less.• Give up to 1 of your opponent''s Characters 1 cost during this turn.', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/media/static/Card_Images/OP06-021_p2.jpg', 'Extra Booster: Anime 25th Collection', 'EB-02', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/api/sets/card/OP06-021/'),
  ('onepiece', 'EB-02:OP07-059_p2', 'Foxy (SPR)', 'Leader', 'L', '[When Attacking] DON!! 3 (You may return the specified number of DON!! cards from your field to your DON!! deck.): If you have 3 or more "Foxy Pirates" type Characters, select your opponent''s rested Leader and up to 1 Character card. The selected cards will not become active in your opponent''s next Refresh Phase.', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/media/static/Card_Images/OP07-059_p2.jpg', 'Extra Booster: Anime 25th Collection', 'EB-02', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/api/sets/card/OP07-059/'),
  ('onepiece', 'EB-02:OP05-060_p4', 'Monkey.D.Luffy (SPR)', 'Leader', 'L', '[Activate: Main] [Once Per Turn] You may add 1 card from the top of your Life cards to your hand: If you have 0 or 3 or more DON!! cards on your field, add up to 1 DON!! card from your DON!! deck and set it as active.', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/media/static/Card_Images/OP05-060_p4.jpg', 'Extra Booster: Anime 25th Collection', 'EB-02', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/api/sets/card/OP05-060/'),
  ('onepiece', 'EB-02:OP07-079_p2', 'Rob Lucci (SPR)', 'Leader', 'L', '[When Attacking] You may trash 2 cards from the top of your deck: Give up to 1 of your opponent''s Characters 1 cost during this turn.', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/media/static/Card_Images/OP07-079_p2.jpg', 'Extra Booster: Anime 25th Collection', 'EB-02', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/api/sets/card/OP07-079/'),
  ('onepiece', 'EB-02:EB01-001_p2', 'Kouzuki Oden (SPR)', 'Leader', 'L', 'All of your "Land of Wano" type Character cards without a Counter have a +1000 Counter, according to the rules.[DON!! x1] [When Attacking] If you have a "Land of Wano" type Character with a cost of 5 or more, this Leader gains +1000 power until the start of your next turn.', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/media/static/Card_Images/EB01-001_p2.jpg', 'Extra Booster: Anime 25th Collection', 'EB-02', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/api/sets/card/EB01-001/'),
  ('onepiece', 'EB-02:OP06-020_p2', 'Hody Jones (SPR)', 'Leader', 'L', '[Activate: Main] You may rest this Leader: Rest up to 1 of your opponent''s DON!! cards or Characters with a cost of 3 or less. Then, you cannot add Life cards to your hand using your own effects during this turn.', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/media/static/Card_Images/OP06-020_p2.jpg', 'Extra Booster: Anime 25th Collection', 'EB-02', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/api/sets/card/OP06-020/'),
  ('onepiece', 'EB-02:EB01-021_p2', 'Hannyabal (SPR)', 'Leader', 'L', '[End of Your Turn] You may return 1 of your "Impel Down" type Characters with a cost of 2 or more to the owner''s hand: Add up to 1 DON!! card from your DON!! deck and set it as active.', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/media/static/Card_Images/EB01-021_p2.jpg', 'Extra Booster: Anime 25th Collection', 'EB-02', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/api/sets/card/EB01-021/'),
  ('onepiece', 'EB-02:OP06-001_p2', 'Uta (SPR)', 'Leader', 'L', '[When Attacking] You may trash 1 "FILM" type card from your hand: Give up to 1 of your opponent''s Characters 2000 power during this turn. Then, add up to 1 DON!! card from your DON!! deck and rest it.', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/media/static/Card_Images/OP06-001_p2.jpg', 'Extra Booster: Anime 25th Collection', 'EB-02', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/api/sets/card/OP06-001/'),
  ('onepiece', 'EB-02:OP07-038_p2', 'Boa Hancock (SPR)', 'Leader', 'L', '[Your Turn] [Once Per Turn] This effect can be activated when a Character is removed from the field by your effect. If you have 5 or less cards in your hand, draw 1 card.', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/media/static/Card_Images/OP07-038_p2.jpg', 'Extra Booster: Anime 25th Collection', 'EB-02', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/api/sets/card/OP07-038/'),
  ('onepiece', 'EB-02:OP05-098_p2', 'Enel (SPR)', 'Leader', 'L', '[Opponent''s Turn] [Once Per Turn] When your number of Life cards becomes 0, add 1 card from the top of your deck to the top of your Life cards. Then, trash 1 card from your hand.', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/media/static/Card_Images/OP05-098_p2.jpg', 'Extra Booster: Anime 25th Collection', 'EB-02', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/api/sets/card/OP05-098/'),
  ('onepiece', 'EB-02:OP06-080_p2', 'Gecko Moria (SPR)', 'Leader', 'L', '[DON!! x1] [When Attacking] 2 (You may rest the specified number of DON!! cards in your cost area.) You may trash 1 card from your hand: Trash 2 cards from the top of your deck and play up to 1 "Thriller Bark Pirates" type Character card with a cost of 4 or less from your trash.', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/media/static/Card_Images/OP06-080_p2.jpg', 'Extra Booster: Anime 25th Collection', 'EB-02', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/api/sets/card/OP06-080/'),
  ('onepiece', 'EB-02:OP08-001_p2', 'Tony Tony.Chopper (SPR)', 'Leader', 'L', '[Activate: Main] [Once Per Turn] Give up to 3 of your "Animal" or "Drum Kingdom" type Characters up to 1 rested DON!! card each.', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/media/static/Card_Images/OP08-001_p2.jpg', 'Extra Booster: Anime 25th Collection', 'EB-02', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/api/sets/card/OP08-001/'),
  ('onepiece', 'EB-02:OP07-097_p2', 'Vegapunk (SPR)', 'Leader', 'L', 'This Leader cannot attack.[Activate: Main] [Once Per Turn] 1 (You may rest the specified number of DON!! cards in your cost area.): Select up to 1 "Egghead" type card with a cost of 5 or less from your hand and play it or add it to the top of your Life cards face-up.', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/media/static/Card_Images/OP07-097_p2.jpg', 'Extra Booster: Anime 25th Collection', 'EB-02', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/api/sets/card/OP07-097/'),
  ('onepiece', 'EB-02:EB01-040_p2', 'Kyros (SPR)', 'Leader', 'L', '[Activate: Main] [Once Per Turn] You may turn 1 card from the top of your Life cards face-up: K.O. up to 1 of your opponent''s Characters with a cost of 0.', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/media/static/Card_Images/EB01-040_p2.jpg', 'Extra Booster: Anime 25th Collection', 'EB-02', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/api/sets/card/EB01-040/'),
  ('onepiece', 'EB-02:OP08-057_p2', 'King (SPR)', 'Leader', 'L', '[Activate: Main] [Once Per Turn] DON!! 2 (You may return the specified number of DON!! cards from your field to your DON!! deck.): Choose one:• If you have 5 or less cards in your hand, draw 1 card.• Give up to 1 of your opponent''s Characters 2 cost during this turn.', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/media/static/Card_Images/OP08-057_p2.jpg', 'Extra Booster: Anime 25th Collection', 'EB-02', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/api/sets/card/OP08-057/'),
  ('onepiece', 'EB-02:OP08-098_p2', 'Kalgara (SPR)', 'Leader', 'L', '[DON!! x1] [When Attacking] Play up to 1 "Shandian Warrior" type Character card from your hand with a cost equal to or less than the number of DON!! cards on your field. If you do, add 1 card from the top of your Life cards to your hand.', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/media/static/Card_Images/OP08-098_p2.jpg', 'Extra Booster: Anime 25th Collection', 'EB-02', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/api/sets/card/OP08-098/'),
  ('onepiece', 'EB-01:EB01-051', 'Finger Pistol', 'Event', 'R', '[Main] You may trash 2 cards from the top of your deck: K.O. up to 1 of your opponent''s Characters with a cost of 5 or less.', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/media/static/Card_Images/EB01-051.jpg', 'Extra Booster: Memorial Collection', 'EB-01', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/api/sets/card/EB01-051/'),
