  ('onepiece', 'EB-01:EB01-012', 'Cavendish', 'Character', 'SR', '[On Play]/[When Attacking] If your Leader has the [Supernovas] type and you have no other [Cavendish] Characters, set up to 2 of your DON!! cards as active.', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/media/static/Card_Images/EB01-012.jpg', 'Extra Booster: Memorial Collection', 'EB-01', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/api/sets/card/EB01-012/'),
  ('onepiece', 'EB-01:EB01-061', 'Mr.2.Bon.Kurei (Bentham)', 'Character', 'SEC', '[On Play] Add up to 1 DON!! card from your DON!! deck and set it as active.[When Attacking] Select up to 1 of your opponent''s Characters. This Character''s base power becomes the same as the selected Character''s power during this turn.', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/media/static/Card_Images/EB01-061.jpg', 'Extra Booster: Memorial Collection', 'EB-01', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/api/sets/card/EB01-061/'),
