  ('onepiece', 'PRB-02:PRB02-018', 'Portgas.D.Ace - PRB02-018', 'Character', 'R', '[On Play] If you have a face-up Life card, play up to 1 [Sabo], [Portgas.D.Ace], or [Monkey.D.Luffy] with a cost of 2 from your hand or trash.', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/media/static/Card_Images/PRB02-018.jpg', 'Premium Booster -The Best- Vol. 2', 'PRB-02', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/api/sets/card/PRB02-018/'),
  ('onepiece', 'PRB-02:EB01-046_r1', 'Brook - EB01-046 (Reprint)', 'Character', 'SR', '[On Play]/[When Attacking] Give up to 1 of your opponent''s Characters -1 cost during this turn. Then, K.O. up to 1 of your opponent''s Characters with a cost of 0.Disclaimer: This card was reprinted from the original set with changes to the copyright information (Note: the original print did not include "EN" at the end of the copyright).', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/media/static/Card_Images/EB01-046_r1.jpg', 'Premium Booster -The Best- Vol. 2', 'PRB-02', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/api/sets/card/EB01-046/'),
  ('onepiece', 'PRB-02:PRB02-001', 'Koby', 'Character', 'R', '[Opponent''s Turn] If your Leader has the "Navy" type, this Character gains +1000 power.[When Attacking] K.O. up to 1 of your opponent''s Characters with 3000 base power or less. Then, if you have 6 or less cards in your hand, draw 1 card.', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/media/static/Card_Images/PRB02-001.jpg', 'Premium Booster -The Best- Vol. 2', 'PRB-02', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/api/sets/card/PRB02-001/'),
  ('onepiece', 'PRB-02:PRB02-010', 'Charlotte Pudding - PRB02-010', 'Character', 'SR', '[On Play] DON!! -2: If your Leader has the "Big Mom Pirates" type and your opponent has 6 or more DON!! cards on their field, draw 2 cards. Then, play up to 1 "Big Mom Pirates" type Character card with 6000 to 8000 power from your hand.', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/media/static/Card_Images/PRB02-010.jpg', 'Premium Booster -The Best- Vol. 2', 'PRB-02', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/api/sets/card/PRB02-010/'),
  ('onepiece', 'PRB-02:PRB02-014', 'Sabo - PRB02-014', 'Character', 'SR', 'If you have 15 or more cards in your trash, give this card in your hand -3 cost.[Blocker] (After your opponent declares an attack, you may rest this card to make it the new target of the attack.)', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/media/static/Card_Images/PRB02-014.jpg', 'Premium Booster -The Best- Vol. 2', 'PRB-02', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/api/sets/card/PRB02-014/'),
  ('onepiece', 'PRB-02:PRB02-006', 'Roronoa Zoro - PRB02-006', 'Character', 'R', '[Opponent''s Turn] If this Character would be rested by your opponent''s Character''s effect, you may rest 1 of your other Characters instead.[Blocker]', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/media/static/Card_Images/PRB02-006.jpg', 'Premium Booster -The Best- Vol. 2', 'PRB-02', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/api/sets/card/PRB02-006/'),
  ('onepiece', 'PRB-02:PRB02-017', 'Boa Hancock', 'Character', 'SR', '[Once Per Turn] You may trash 1 card with a [Trigger] from your hand: Your opponent''s rested Leader or up to 1 of your opponent''s Characters other than [Monkey.D.Luffy] cannot attack until the end of your opponent''s next End Phase.[Trigger] K.O up to 1 of your opponent''s Characters with a cost of 4 or less', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/media/static/Card_Images/PRB02-017.jpg', 'Premium Booster -The Best- Vol. 2', 'PRB-02', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/api/sets/card/PRB02-017/'),
  ('onepiece', 'PRB-02:PRB02-004', 'Jewelry Bonney -PRB02-004', 'Character', 'R', '[Blocker] (After your opponent declares an attack, you may rest this card to make it the new target of the attack.)[On Your Opponent''s Attack] [Once Per Turn] Set up to 1 of your DON!! cards as active.', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/media/static/Card_Images/PRB02-004_GgQQXru.jpg', 'Premium Booster -The Best- Vol. 2', 'PRB-02', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/api/sets/card/PRB02-004/'),
  ('onepiece', 'PRB-02:PRB02-016', 'Otama', 'Character', 'R', '[Activate: Main] You may rest this Character and add 1 card from the top or bottom of your Life cards to your hand: Up to 1 of your Leader or Character cards gains +3000 power during this turn.[Trigger] Rest up to 1 of your opponent''s Characters with a cost of 4 or less.', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/media/static/Card_Images/PRB02-016.jpg', 'Premium Booster -The Best- Vol. 2', 'PRB-02', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/api/sets/card/PRB02-016/'),
  ('onepiece', 'PRB-02:OP07-064_r1', 'Sanji (Reprint)', 'Character', 'SR', 'If the number of DON!! cards on your field is at least 2 less than the number on your opponent''s field, give this card in your hand -3 cost.[Blocker] (After your opponent declares an attack, you may rest this card to make it the new target of the attack.)Disclaimer: This card was reprinted from the original set with changes to the copyright information (Note: the original print did not include "EN" at the end of the copyright).', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/media/static/Card_Images/OP07-064_r1.jpg', 'Premium Booster -The Best- Vol. 2', 'PRB-02', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/api/sets/card/OP07-064/'),
  ('onepiece', 'PRB-02:PRB02-013', 'Gecko Moria', 'Character', 'R', '[On Play] If your Leader has the "Thriller Bark Pirates" type, play up to 1 Character card with a cost of 4 or less from your trash rested. Then, give up to 1 rested DON!! card to your Leader or 1 of your Characters.', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/media/static/Card_Images/PRB02-013.jpg', 'Premium Booster -The Best- Vol. 2', 'PRB-02', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/api/sets/card/PRB02-013/'),
  ('onepiece', 'PRB-02:PRB02-005', 'Monkey.D.Luffy - PRB02-005', 'Character', 'SR', '[Your Turn] [On Play] If your Leader is multicolored and your opponent has 7 or less DON!! cards on their field, your opponent rests 1 of their active DON!! cards at the start of their next Main Phase.', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/media/static/Card_Images/PRB02-005.jpg', 'Premium Booster -The Best- Vol. 2', 'PRB-02', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/api/sets/card/PRB02-005/'),
  ('onepiece', 'PRB-02:PRB02-011', 'Donquixote Doflamingo', 'Character', 'R', '[Blocker][On Play] If your Leader is multicolored, add up to 1 DON!! card from your DON!! deck and rest it.', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/media/static/Card_Images/PRB02-011.jpg', 'Premium Booster -The Best- Vol. 2', 'PRB-02', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/api/sets/card/PRB02-011/'),
  ('onepiece', 'PRB-02:OP10-032_r1', 'Tashigi (Reprint)', 'Character', 'SR', 'If you have a green Character other than [Tashigi] that would be removed from the field by your opponent''s effect, you may rest this Character instead.Disclaimer: This card was reprinted from the original set with changes to the copyright information (Note: the original print did not include "EN" at the end of the copyright).', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/media/static/Card_Images/OP10-032_r1.jpg', 'Premium Booster -The Best- Vol. 2', 'PRB-02', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/api/sets/card/OP10-032/'),
  ('onepiece', 'PRB-02:PRB02-003', 'Lucky.Roux', 'Character', 'R', '[Blocker] (After your opponent declares an attack, you may rest this card to make it the new target of the attack.)[On Play] You may trash 1 Character card with 6000 power or more from your hand: Draw 2 cards.', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/media/static/Card_Images/PRB02-003.jpg', 'Premium Booster -The Best- Vol. 2', 'PRB-02', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/api/sets/card/PRB02-003/'),
