  ('onepiece', 'PRB-02:EB01-057_r1', 'Shirahoshi (Reprint)', 'Character', 'SR', 'When this Character is K.O.''d by your opponent''s effect, add up to 1 card from the top of your deck to the top of your Life cards.[Blocker] (After your opponent declares an attack, you may rest this card to make it the new target of the attack.)Disclaimer: This card was reprinted from the original set with changes to the copyright information (Note: the original print did not include "EN" at the end of the copyright).', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/media/static/Card_Images/EB01-057_r1.jpg', 'Premium Booster -The Best- Vol. 2', 'PRB-02', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/api/sets/card/EB01-057/'),
  ('onepiece', 'PRB-02:PRB02-007', 'Jinbe - PRB02-007', 'Character', 'R', '[On Play] Look at 5 cards from the top of your deck; reveal up to 1 "The Seven Warlords of the Sea" type card other than [Jinbe] and add it to your hand. Then, place the rest at the bottom of your deck in any order.', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/media/static/Card_Images/PRB02-007.jpg', 'Premium Booster -The Best- Vol. 2', 'PRB-02', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/api/sets/card/PRB02-007/'),
  ('onepiece', 'PRB-02:PRB02-015', 'Shiryu', 'Character', 'R', 'If your Leader has the "Blackbeard Pirates" type, this Character gains [Blocker] and +4 cost.[On K.O.] If your Leader has the "Blackbeard Pirates" type, K.O. up to 1 of your opponent''s Characters with a base cost of 4 or less.', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/media/static/Card_Images/PRB02-015.jpg', 'Premium Booster -The Best- Vol. 2', 'PRB-02', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/api/sets/card/PRB02-015/'),
  ('onepiece', 'PRB-02:ST18-001_r1', 'Uso-Hachi (Reprint)', 'Character', 'C', '[On Play] If you have 8 or more DON!! cards on your field, rest up to 1 of your opponent''s Characters with a cost of 5 or less.Disclaimer: This card was reprinted from the original set with changes to the copyright information (Note: the original print did not include "EN" at the end of the copyright).', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/media/static/Card_Images/ST18-001_r1.jpg', 'Premium Booster -The Best- Vol. 2', 'PRB-02', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/api/sets/card/ST18-001/'),
  ('onepiece', 'PRB-02:OP04-083_r3', 'Sabo - OP04-083 (Reprint)', 'Character', 'SR', '[Blocker] (After your opponent declares an attack, you may rest this card to make it the new target of the attack.)[On Play] None of your Characters can be K.O.''d by effects until the start of your next turn. Then, draw 2 cards and trash 2 cards from your hand.Disclaimer: This card was reprinted from the original set with changes to the copyright information (Note: the original print did not include "EN" at the end of the copyright) and the Artist Credit (Note: there is no pencil design on top of the artist name).', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/media/static/Card_Images/OP04-083_r3.jpg', 'Premium Booster -The Best- Vol. 2', 'PRB-02', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/api/sets/card/OP04-083/'),
  ('onepiece', 'PRB-02:EB01-061_r1', 'Mr.2.Bon.Kurei (Bentham) (Reprint)', 'Character', 'SEC', '[On Play] Add up to 1 DON!! card from your DON!! deck and set it as active.[When Attacking] Select up to 1 of your opponent''s Characters. This Character''s base power becomes the same as the selected Character''s power during this turn.Disclaimer: This card was reprinted from the original set with changes to the copyright information (Note: the original print did not include "EN" at the end of the copyright).', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/media/static/Card_Images/EB01-061_r1.jpg', 'Premium Booster -The Best- Vol. 2', 'PRB-02', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/api/sets/card/EB01-061/'),
  ('onepiece', 'PRB-02:PRB02-009', 'Mr.3(Galdino) - PRB02-009', 'Character', 'R', 'This effect can be activated when this Character is rested by your opponent''s effect. You may trash this Character and draw 2 cards.[Blocker]', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/media/static/Card_Images/PRB02-009.jpg', 'Premium Booster -The Best- Vol. 2', 'PRB-02', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/api/sets/card/PRB02-009/'),
  ('onepiece', 'PRB-02:OP05-091_r1', 'Rebecca (Reprint)', 'Character', 'SR', '[Blocker][On Play] Add up to 1 black Character card with a cost of 3 to 7 other than [Rebecca] from your trash to your hand. Then, play up to 1 black Character card with a cost of 3 or less from your hand rested.Disclaimer: This card was reprinted from the original set with changes to the copyright information (Note: the original print did not include "EN" at the end of the copyright) and the Artist Credit (Note: there is no pencil design on top of the artist name).', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/media/static/Card_Images/OP05-091_r1.jpg', 'Premium Booster -The Best- Vol. 2', 'PRB-02', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/api/sets/card/OP05-091/'),
  ('onepiece', 'PRB-02:EB02-061_r1', 'Monkey.D.Luffy - EB02-061 (SP)', 'Character', 'SEC', 'If your Leader is multicolored and your opponent has 5 or more DON!! cards on their field, this Character gains [Rush].[When Attacking] [Once Per Turn] You may return 2 of your active DON!! cards to your DON!! deck: Set this Character as active. Then, add 1 card from the top of your Life cards to your hand.', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/media/static/Card_Images/EB02-061_r1.jpg', 'Premium Booster -The Best- Vol. 2', 'PRB-02', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/api/sets/card/EB02-061/'),
  ('onepiece', 'PRB-02:OP08-118_r1', 'Silvers Rayleigh - OP08-118 (Reprint)', 'Character', 'SEC', '[On Play] Select up to 2 of your opponent''s Characters, and give 1 Character 3000 power and the other 2000 power until the end of your opponent''s next turn. Then, K.O. up to 1 of your opponent''s Characters with 3000 power or less.Disclaimer: This card was reprinted from the original set with changes to the copyright information (Note: the original print did not include "EN" at the end of the copyright).', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/media/static/Card_Images/OP08-118_r1.jpg', 'Premium Booster -The Best- Vol. 2', 'PRB-02', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/api/sets/card/OP08-118/'),
