  ('onepiece', 'PRB-02:OP10-112_r1', 'Eustass"Captain"Kid (Reprint)', 'Character', 'SR', '[On Play] You may rest this Character: Trash up to 1 card from the top of your opponent''s Life cards.[End of Your Turn] If your opponent has 2 or less Life cards, draw 1 card and trash 1 card from your hand.Disclaimer: This card was reprinted from the original set with changes to the copyright information (Note: the original print did not include "EN" at the end of the copyright).', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/media/static/Card_Images/OP10-112_r1.jpg', 'Premium Booster -The Best- Vol. 2', 'PRB-02', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/api/sets/card/OP10-112/'),
