  ('onepiece', 'PRB-02:EB01-038_p1', 'Oh Come My Way (Pirate Foil)', 'Event', 'C', '[Counter] DON!! -1 (You may return the specified number of DON!! cards from your field to your DON!! deck.): If your Leader''s type includes "Baroque Works", select 1 of your Characters. Change the attack target to the selected Character.[Trigger] DON!! -1: Draw 2 cards.', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/media/static/Card_Images/EB01-038_p1.jpg', 'Premium Booster -The Best- Vol. 2', 'PRB-02', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/api/sets/card/EB01-038/'),
