  ('onepiece', 'PRB-02:OP05-037_r1', 'Because the Side of Justice Will Be Whichever Side Wins!! (Reprint)', 'Event', 'R', '[Counter] You may trash 1 card from your hand: Up to 1 of your Leader or Character cards gains +3000 power during this battle.[Trigger] Rest up to 1 of your opponent''s Characters with a cost of 4 or less.Disclaimer: This card was reprinted from the original set with changes to the copyright information (Note: the original print did not include "EN" at the end of the copyright).', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/media/static/Card_Images/OP05-037_r1.jpg', 'Premium Booster -The Best- Vol. 2', 'PRB-02', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/api/sets/card/OP05-037/'),
  ('onepiece', 'PRB-02:OP10-114_p1', 'X.Drake (Pirate Foil)', 'Character', 'UC', '[Activate: Main] You may rest this Character: If the number of your Life cards is equal to or less than the number of your opponent''s Life cards, rest up to 1 of your opponent''s Characters with a cost of 4 or less.', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/media/static/Card_Images/OP10-114_p1.jpg', 'Premium Booster -The Best- Vol. 2', 'PRB-02', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/api/sets/card/OP10-114/'),
