  ('onepiece', 'PRB-02:PRB02-007_p1', 'Jinbe - PRB02-007(Alternate Art)', 'Character', 'R', '[On Play] Look at 5 cards from the top of your deck; reveal up to 1 "The Seven Warlords of the Sea" type card other than [Jinbe] and add it to your hand. Then, place the rest at the bottom of your deck in any order.', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/media/static/Card_Images/PRB02-007_p1.jpg', 'Premium Booster -The Best- Vol. 2', 'PRB-02', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/api/sets/card/PRB02-007/'),
