  ('onepiece', 'PRB-02:PRB02-010_p1', 'Charlotte Pudding - PRB02-010 (Alternate Art)', 'Character', 'SR', '[On Play] DON!! -2: If your Leader has the "Big Mom Pirates" type and your opponent has 6 or more DON!! cards on their field, draw 2 cards. Then, play up to 1 "Big Mom Pirates" type Character card with 6000 to 8000 power from your hand.', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/media/static/Card_Images/PRB02-010_p1.jpg', 'Premium Booster -The Best- Vol. 2', 'PRB-02', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/api/sets/card/PRB02-010/'),
  ('onepiece', 'PRB-02:OP06-044_p1', 'Gion (Pirate Foil)', 'Character', 'UC', '[Your Turn][Once Per Turn] When your opponent activates an Event, your opponent must place 1 card from their hand at the bottom of their deck.', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/media/static/Card_Images/OP06-044_p1.jpg', 'Premium Booster -The Best- Vol. 2', 'PRB-02', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/api/sets/card/OP06-044/'),
