  ('onepiece', 'PRB-02:OP09-002_r1', 'Uta (Reprint)', 'Character', 'R', '[On Play] Look at 5 cards from the top of your deck; reveal up to 1 "Red-Haired Pirates" type card and add it to your hand. Then, place the rest at the bottom of your deck in any order.Disclaimer: This card was reprinted from the original set with changes to the copyright information (Note: the original print did not include "EN" at the end of the copyright).', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/media/static/Card_Images/OP09-002_r1.jpg', 'Premium Booster -The Best- Vol. 2', 'PRB-02', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/api/sets/card/OP09-002/'),
  ('onepiece', 'PRB-02:P-069_r1', 'Koala (Reprint)', 'Character', 'PR', '[Activate:Main] [Once Per Turn] Give up to 1 rested DON!! card to your Leader or 1 of your Characters.Disclaimer: This card was reprinted from the original set with a different border (Note: the original print had a full art border).', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/media/static/Card_Images/P-069_r1.jpg', 'Premium Booster -The Best- Vol. 2', 'PRB-02', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/api/sets/card/P-069/'),
  ('onepiece', 'PRB-02:ST13-019_p1', 'The Three Brothers'' Bond (Pirate Foil)', 'Event', 'C', '[Main] Look at 5 cards from the top of your deck; reveal up to 1 [Sabo], [Portgas.D.Ace], or [Monkey.D.Luffy] with a cost of 5 or less and add it to your hand. Then, place the rest at the bottom of your deck in any order.[Trigger] Activate this card''s [Main] effect.', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/media/static/Card_Images/ST13-019_p1.jpg', 'Premium Booster -The Best- Vol. 2', 'PRB-02', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/api/sets/card/ST13-019/'),
