  ('onepiece', 'PRB-02:PRB02-013_p1', 'Gecko Moria (Alternate Art)', 'Character', 'R', '[On Play] If your Leader has the "Thriller Bark Pirates" type, play up to 1 Character card with a cost of 4 or less from your trash rested. Then, give up to 1 rested DON!! card to your Leader or 1 of your Characters.', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/media/static/Card_Images/PRB02-013_p1.jpg', 'Premium Booster -The Best- Vol. 2', 'PRB-02', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/api/sets/card/PRB02-013/'),
