  ('onepiece', 'PRB-02:OP09-069_r1', 'Trafalgar Law - OP09-069 (Reprint)', 'Character', 'R', '[On Play] Look at 4 cards from the top of your deck; reveal up to 1 "Straw Hat Crew" or "Heart Pirates" type card with a cost of 2 or more and add it to your hand. Then, place the rest at the bottom of your deck in any order.Disclaimer: This card was reprinted from the original set with changes to the copyright information (Note: the original print did not include "EN" at the end of the copyright).', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/media/static/Card_Images/OP09-069_r1.jpg', 'Premium Booster -The Best- Vol. 2', 'PRB-02', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/api/sets/card/OP09-069/'),
