  ('onepiece', 'PRB-02:PRB02-015_p1', 'Shiryu (Alternate Art)', 'Character', 'R', 'If your Leader has the "Blackbeard Pirates" type, this Character gains [Blocker] and +4 cost.[On K.O.] If your Leader has the "Blackbeard Pirates" type, K.O. up to 1 of your opponent''s Characters with a base cost of 4 or less.', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/media/static/Card_Images/PRB02-015_p1.jpg', 'Premium Booster -The Best- Vol. 2', 'PRB-02', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/api/sets/card/PRB02-015/'),
  ('onepiece', 'PRB-02:PRB02-011_p1', 'Donquixote Doflamingo (Alternate Art)', 'Character', 'R', '[Blocker][On Play] If your Leader is multicolored, add up to 1 DON!! card from your DON!! deck and rest it.', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/media/static/Card_Images/PRB02-011_p1.jpg', 'Premium Booster -The Best- Vol. 2', 'PRB-02', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/api/sets/card/PRB02-011/'),
  ('onepiece', 'PRB-02:ST13-010_r1', 'Portgas.D.Ace - ST13-010 (Reprint)', 'Character', 'C', '[Activate: Main] You may trash this Character: Reveal 1 card from the top of your Life cards. If that card is a [Portgas.D.Ace] with a cost of 5, you may play that card. If you do, up to 1 of your Leader gains +2000 power until the end of your opponent''s next turn.Disclaimer: This card was reprinted from the original set with changes to the copyright information (Note: the original print did not include "EN" at the end of the copyright).', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/media/static/Card_Images/ST13-010_r1.jpg', 'Premium Booster -The Best- Vol. 2', 'PRB-02', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/api/sets/card/ST13-010/'),
  ('onepiece', 'PRB-02:OP07-076', 'Slow-Slow Beam Sword (Reprint)', 'Event', 'C', '[Counter] DON!! -1 (You may return the specified number of DON!! cards from your field to your DON!! deck.): Up to 1 of your Leader or Character cards gains +2000 power during this battle. Then, rest up to 1 of your opponent''s Characters.[Trigger] Add up to 1 DON!! card from your DON!! deck and set it as active.Disclaimer: This card was reprinted from the original set with changes to the copyright information (Note: the original print did not include "EN" at the end of the copyright).', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/media/static/Card_Images/OP07-076_r1.jpg', 'Premium Booster -The Best- Vol. 2', 'PRB-02', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/api/sets/card/OP07-076/'),
  ('onepiece', 'PRB-02:PRB02-018_p1', 'Portgas.D.Ace - PRB02-018 (Alternate Art)', 'Character', 'R', '[On Play] If you have a face-up Life card, play up to 1 [Sabo], [Portgas.D.Ace], or [Monkey.D.Luffy] with a cost of 2 from your hand or trash.', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/media/static/Card_Images/PRB02-018_p1.jpg', 'Premium Booster -The Best- Vol. 2', 'PRB-02', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/api/sets/card/PRB02-018/'),
  ('onepiece', 'PRB-02:OP07-040_p3', 'Crocodile - OP07-040 (Alternate Art)', 'Character', 'UC', '[On Play] (1) (You may rest the specified number of DON!! cards in your cost area.): Return up to 1 Character with a cost of 2 or less to the owner''s hand.', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/media/static/Card_Images/OP07-040_p3.jpg', 'Premium Booster -The Best- Vol. 2', 'PRB-02', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/api/sets/card/OP07-040/'),
