  ('onepiece', 'PRB-02:OP08-023_p1', 'Carrot (SP)', 'Character', 'SR', '[On Play]/[When Attacking] Up to 1 of your opponent''s rested Characters with a cost of 7 or less will not become active in your opponent''s next Refresh Phase.', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/media/static/Card_Images/OP08-023_p1_8FjIUrx.jpg', 'Premium Booster -The Best- Vol. 2', 'PRB-02', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/api/sets/card/OP08-023/'),
