  ('onepiece', 'OP14-EB04:OP14-103', 'Gloriosa (Grandma Nyon)', 'Character', 'C', '[On Play] You may add 1 card from the top or bottom of your Life cards to your hand: Add up to 1 card from your hand to the top of your Life cards. [Trigger] Play this card.', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/media/static/Card_Images/OP14-103_ebdAde3.jpg', 'The Azure Sea''s Seven', 'OP14-EB04', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/api/sets/card/OP14-103/'),
