  ('onepiece', 'OP14-EB04:OP14-038', 'I Never Bother to Remember the Faces of Trash', 'Event', 'UC', '[Main] You may rest 2 of your cards: Draw 1 card and rest up to 1 of your opponent''s Characters with 7000 base power or less. [Counter] Your Leader gains +3000 power during this battle.', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/media/static/Card_Images/OP14-038_0NkYUoY.jpg', 'The Azure Sea''s Seven', 'OP14-EB04', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/api/sets/card/OP14-038/'),
  ('onepiece', 'OP14-EB04:EB04-028', 'Ice Time', 'Event', 'R', '[Main] You may trash 1 card from your hand: If your Leader has the {Navy} type, up to 2 of your opponent''s Characters with 10000 power or less cannot attack until the end of your opponent''s next End Phase.', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/media/static/Card_Images/EB04-028_yJSWMQc.jpg', 'The Azure Sea''s Seven', 'OP14-EB04', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/api/sets/card/EB04-028/'),
  ('onepiece', 'OP14-EB04:OP14-009', 'Trafalgar Law - OP14-009', 'Character', 'SR', '[Rush] [On Your Opponent''s Attack] [Once Per Turn] You may trash 2 cards from your hand: Select your Leader and 1 Character. Swap the base power of the selected cards with each other during this battle.', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/media/static/Card_Images/OP14-009_PbcDe5b.jpg', 'The Azure Sea''s Seven', 'OP14-EB04', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/api/sets/card/OP14-009/'),
