  ('onepiece', 'OP14-EB04:OP14-015', 'Roronoa Zoro - OP14-015', 'Character', 'R', '[Rush] (This card can attack on the turn in which it is played.) [When Attacking] Give up to 1 of your opponent''s Characters -1000 power during this turn.', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/media/static/Card_Images/OP14-015_witNsKK.jpg', 'The Azure Sea''s Seven', 'OP14-EB04', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/api/sets/card/OP14-015/'),
