  ('onepiece', 'OP14-EB04:OP14-102', 'Kumacy', 'Character', 'C', '[Trigger] Play up to 1 {Thriller Bark Pirates} type Character card with a cost of 4 or less from your trash rested.', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/media/static/Card_Images/OP14-102_zIuEXKV.jpg', 'The Azure Sea''s Seven', 'OP14-EB04', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/api/sets/card/OP14-102/'),
  ('onepiece', 'OP14-EB04:EB04-014', 'Kouzuki Sukiyaki', 'Character', 'C', '[Blocker] (After your opponent declares an attack, you may rest this card to make it the new target of the attack.) [Activate: Main] [Once Per Turn] Give up to 1 rested DON!! card to your {Land of Wano} type Leader.', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/media/static/Card_Images/EB04-014_YYHvxcU.jpg', 'The Azure Sea''s Seven', 'OP14-EB04', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/api/sets/card/EB04-014/'),
