  ('onepiece', 'EB-03:EB03-044', 'Black Maria', 'Character', 'C', 'If your Leader is multicolored, this Character gains [Blocker]. [On Play] Look at 5 cards from the top of your deck; reveal up to 1 [Onigashima Island] and add it to your hand. Then, place the rest at the bottom of your deck in any order and play up to 1 [Onigashima Island] from your hand.', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/media/static/Card_Images/EB03-044_0WuMWQY.jpg', 'Extra Booster: One Piece Heroines Edition', 'EB-03', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/api/sets/card/EB03-044/'),
  ('onepiece', 'EB-03:EB03-033', 'Charlotte Brulee', 'Character', 'C', '[Opponent''s Turn] [Once Per Turn] When a DON!! card on your field is returned to your DON!! deck by your effect, if your Leader has the {Big Mom Pirates} type, add up to 1 DON!! card from your DON!! deck and rest it.', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/media/static/Card_Images/EB03-033_ouN0qDl.jpg', 'Extra Booster: One Piece Heroines Edition', 'EB-03', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/api/sets/card/EB03-033/'),
  ('onepiece', 'EB-03:EB03-049', 'I Knew You People Were Behind This.', 'Event', 'C', '[Main] You may rest 7 of your DON!! cards: If your Leader is [Perona], play up to 1 {Thriller Bark Pirates} type Character card with a cost of 6 or less and up to 1 {Thriller Bark Pirates} type Character card with a cost of 4 or less from your hand or trash. [Counter] Your Leader gains +3000 power during this battle.', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/media/static/Card_Images/EB03-049_pm5E11N.jpg', 'Extra Booster: One Piece Heroines Edition', 'EB-03', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/api/sets/card/EB03-049/'),
  ('onepiece', 'EB-03:EB03-029', 'Insolent Fool!! Stand Down!!', 'Event', 'C', '[Main] You may rest 4 of your DON!! cards: If your Leader is [Boa Hancock], play up to 1 {Amazon Lily} or {Kuja Pirates} type Character card with a cost of 6 or less from your hand. [Counter] Up to 1 of your [Boa Hancock] cards gains +3000 power during this battle.', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/media/static/Card_Images/EB03-029_LFPesuP.jpg', 'Extra Booster: One Piece Heroines Edition', 'EB-03', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/api/sets/card/EB03-029/'),
