  ('onepiece', 'EB-03:EB03-010', 'Monet', 'Character', 'R', '[Blocker] [On Play] Look at 5 cards from the top of your deck; reveal up to 1 Character card with 1000 power or less or up to 1 Event card and add it to your hand. Then, place the rest at the bottom of your deck in any order.', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/media/static/Card_Images/EB03-010_QHsFxSc.jpg', 'Extra Booster: One Piece Heroines Edition', 'EB-03', 'https://www.optcgapi.com/api/sets/card/EB03-010/'),
